# Integrations: MCP first

- Confluence/Jira/TestRail: use MCP or CLI (`gh`, `./gradlew exportTestRail`), not new Java clients in `common/integrations/` unless user explicitly requests fallback.
- Never commit API tokens or passwords.
- Jira: draft only in `build/jira-draft.md`; create issue only after human approval.

See `docs/integrations/` and `docs/ai-workflow.md`.
